Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:17:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 140/165] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali: Add CAMSS and CSIPHY
 block definitions

Describe the CAMSS and CSIPHY blocks on Kaanapali so that camera pipelines
can be enabled by board device trees.

The camera subsystem contains:
- 6 x CSIPHY (CSI Physical Layer)
- 3 x TPG (Test Pattern Generator)
- 3 x CSID (CSI Decoder)
- 2 x CSID Lite
- 3 x VFE (Video Front End), 5 RDI per VFE
- 2 x VFE Lite, 4 RDI per VFE Lite

Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patchwork.kernel.org/series/1192881/ (v22)
(cherry picked from commit d6b7fa636ce0553f24191650c34bed84f20fc6dd)
